        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Timothy McSweeney's Quarterly Concern, SCRYE\n- People: Dave Eggers, Jincy Willett\n- Topics: literary journals, gaming magazines, short stories, reportage, illustrations, anthologies, periodicals\n\nFacts:\n- SCRYE, also called Scrye Collectible Card Game Checklist and Price Guide, was a gaming magazine that was published from 1994 until April 2009 and was later discontinued.\n- Timothy McSweeney's Quarterly Concern was first published in 1998.\n- Timothy McSweeney's Quarterly Concern is an American literary journal that typically contains short stories, reportage, and illustrations.\n- Dave Eggers edits Timothy McSweeney's Quarterly Concern.\n- Jincy Willett wrote short pieces for various anthologies and periodicals, including the Winter 2006 issue of Timothy McSweeney's Quarterly Concern and Children Playing Before a Statue of Hercules.",
